    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lemonia The Last Castle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would you do if you were suddenly transported to a world where life and its rules are completely different? <strong>Lemonia The Last Castle</strong> takes you on an immersive journey to an unknown planet, blending mystery and survival elements into a captivating adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For reasons unknown, you find yourself in <strong>Lemonia</strong>, a walled town surrounded by danger. Inside, life goes on as usual, but beyond the walls, zombies roam freely. While the townspeople struggle to maintain their daily lives, you must find your place in this strange new world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 A modern town filled with survivors, each trying to live their lives despite the looming threats outside.<br>-\u00a0<strong>Non-Combat Survival</strong> \u2013 You are just an ordinary civilian. Instead of fighting zombies head-on, you must find alternative ways to survive.<br>-\u00a0<strong>Mystery &amp; Exploration</strong> \u2013 Uncover the town\u2019s secrets, interact with its inhabitants, and try to understand how you got here.<br>-\u00a0<strong>Engaging Storyline</strong> \u2013 Strange events will pull you deeper into the mystery, forcing you to face the truth behind your arrival.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lemonia The Last Castle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would you do if you were suddenly transported to a world where life and its rules are completely different? <strong>Lemonia The Last Castle</strong> takes you on an immersive journey to an unknown planet, blending mystery and survival elements into a captivating adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For reasons unknown, you find yourself in <strong>Lemonia</strong>, a walled town surrounded by danger. Inside, life goes on as usual, but beyond the walls, zombies roam freely. While the townspeople struggle to maintain their daily lives, you must find your place in this strange new world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 A modern town filled with survivors, each trying to live their lives despite the looming threats outside.<br>-\u00a0<strong>Non-Combat Survival</strong> \u2013 You are just an ordinary civilian. Instead of fighting zombies head-on, you must find alternative ways to survive.<br>-\u00a0<strong>Mystery &amp; Exploration</strong> \u2013 Uncover the town\u2019s secrets, interact with its inhabitants, and try to understand how you got here.<br>-\u00a0<strong>Engaging Storyline</strong> \u2013 Strange events will pull you deeper into the mystery, forcing you to face the truth behind your arrival.</p></li></ul>",
